# Keyword-Only Public API

Call every public function by name, not by position. Signatures enforce this.

- After `self` (or at the start of a module-level function), put `*`.
- Call sites, examples, and docs pass every argument as `name=value`.
- Do not add a positional parameter because one value is usual.

## Exceptions

These stay positional because they are protocols, not our API:

- `nn.Module.forward` — `model(batch)`, `head(h)`, `backbone(embeds)`
- Collection dunders — `__len__`, `__getitem__`, `__iter__`, `__repr__`
- Single-value apply callables — `tokenizer(step)`, `augmenter(step)`,
  `compose(...)(step)`, `schedule(x)`
